# Cori-Steel Cutter: "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn" counts only its controller's spells. Bot2 casts two
# Ornithopters on turn 2 while Bot1 controls the Cutter: no Monk arrives for Bot1. The positive control, Bot1's own second
# spell making the Monk, is cori-steel-cutter-flurry-fires-on-the-second-spell-only-and-the-monk-attacks-at-once.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Cori-Steel Cutter
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
